  "styles": "body { margin: 0; }\n    a { color: #6b521f; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: rgba(138,109,59,0.35); }\n    a:hover { color: #5c4826; }\n    ::selection { background: rgba(138,109,59,0.25); }",
  "template": "<div lang=\"es\" style=\"width:100%; min-height:100vh; background:#0a0a09; font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n\n  \n\n  \n\n  <main data-pagefind-meta=\"url:/coleccion/moneda-colonial/provincia-de-pensilvania/\" id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:56px 24px 80px; outline:none;\">\n\n    <a href=\"/coleccion/moneda-colonial/\" style=\"display:inline-block; color:#e7ddc4; text-decoration:none; font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.08em; margin-bottom:24px;\">&larr; Catálogo de Moneda Colonial</a>\n\n    <div style=\"background:#d8d2cd; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.08); border-radius:3px; padding:clamp(28px,4vw,64px); box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);\">\n\n      <div style=\"text-align:center; max-width:760px; margin:0 auto 48px;\">\n        <span style=\"display:block; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.22em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; margin-bottom:14px;\">Moneda Colonial &middot; Pensilvania &middot; 1 de octubre de 1773</span>\n        <h1 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,46px); line-height:1.08; letter-spacing:0.01em; color:#1c1a15; margin:0 0 12px;\">Provincia de Pensilvania</h1>\n        <p style=\"font-size:clamp(19px,2vw,23px); font-style:italic; color:#4a4331; margin:0;\">Dos Chelines y Seis Peniques y Cinco Chelines &middot; Filadelfia</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.75; color:#332e22; max-width:760px; margin:0 auto 56px;\">El 1 de octubre de 1773, la Asamblea General de Pensilvania autorizó una nueva emisión de papel moneda colonial en varias denominaciones, impresa por Hall and Sellers de Filadelfia &mdash;sucesores directos del taller que perteneció a Benjamin Franklin. Estos dos billetes, de dos chelines y seis peniques (&ldquo;Half-a-Crown&rdquo;) y de cinco chelines (&ldquo;A Crown&rdquo;), circularon en las semanas previas al Motín del Té de Boston, en vísperas de la Revolución americana.</p>\n\n      <!-- ===== DOS CHELINES Y SEIS PENIQUES ===== -->\n      <section id=\"2-chelines-6-peniques\" style=\"max-width:760px; margin:0 auto 64px;\">\n\n        <h2 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,30px); color:#1c1a15; text-align:center; margin:0 0 28px;\">Dos Chelines y Seis Peniques (&ldquo;Half-a-Crown&rdquo;)</h2>\n\n        <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 0 40px;\">\n          <button\n            data-zoom-trigger=\"pa-2s6d\"\n            aria-label=\"Ampliar imagen del billete de dos chelines y seis peniques\"\n            style=\"all:unset; display:block; width:100%; position:relative; cursor:zoom-in;\"\n          >\n            <picture>\n              <source srcset=\"uploads/pennsylvania-colonial-2s6d-1773-640.webp 640w, uploads/pennsylvania-colonial-2s6d-1773.webp 564w\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n              <img\n                src=\"uploads/pennsylvania-colonial-2s6d-1773.jpg\"\n                alt=\"Billete colonial de dos chelines y seis peniques de Pensilvania, 1773, anverso arriba y reverso abajo\"\n                width=\"564\"\n                height=\"848\"\n                loading=\"eager\"\n                decoding=\"async\"\n                style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto;\"\n              />\n            </picture>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>\n              Ampliar\n            </span>\n          </button>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center; font-style:italic;\">Anverso (arriba) y reverso (abajo) — Colección de Notofilia.com</span>\n\n          \n            <div\n              role=\"dialog\"\n              aria-modal=\"true\"\n              aria-label=\"Billete de dos chelines y seis peniques ampliado\"\n              data-zoom-dialog=\"pa-2s6d\" hidden style=\"display:none\"\n              style=\"position:fixed; inset:0; z-index:50; background:rgba(5,5,4,0.94); display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\"\n            >\n              <button\n                data-zoom-close\n                aria-label=\"Cerrar\"\n                style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; right:28px; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.4); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:22px; line-height:1; width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer;\"\n              >&times;</button>\n\n              <div style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; left:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.25); border-radius:999px; padding:6px;\">\n                <button disabled=\"\" aria-label=\"Alejar\" style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\">&minus;</button>\n                <span style=\"min-width:56px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; color:#e7ddc4; letter-spacing:0.05em;\"></span>\n                <button disabled=\"\" aria-label=\"Acercar\" style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\">&#43;</button>\n              </div>\n\n              <div\n                style=\"overflow:hidden; max-width:92vw; max-height:74vh; touch-action:none;\"\n              >\n                <picture>\n                  <source srcset=\"uploads/pennsylvania-colonial-2s6d-1773.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n                  <img\n                    src=\"uploads/pennsylvania-colonial-2s6d-1773.jpg\"\n                    alt=\"Billete colonial de dos chelines y seis peniques de Pensilvania, vista ampliada\"\n                    draggable=\"false\"\n                    style=\"display:block; max-width:92vw; max-height:74vh; width:auto; height:auto; transform:; cursor:; user-select:none;\"\n                  />\n                </picture>\n              </div>\n\n              <span style=\"margin-top:18px; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#b7ab8a; font-style:italic;\">Arrastra para mover &middot; Rueda del ratón para ampliar</span>\n            </div>\n          \n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">País / Provincia</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">América Británica &mdash; Provincia de Pensilvania</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Entidad Emisora</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Asamblea General de Pensilvania, bajo el reinado de Jorge III</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Denominación</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Dos Chelines y Seis Peniques (equivalente a &ldquo;HALF-A-CROWN&rdquo;, media corona) &middot; No. 21251</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Fecha de Emisión</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">1 de octubre de 1773</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Impresor</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Hall and Sellers, Filadelfia</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Firmas</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Benjamin Morgan, William Fisher Jr. (rúbrica en tinta roja) y Barnaby Barnes, comisionados firmantes</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Referencia de Catálogo</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Friedberg Fr. PA-165</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <section style=\"margin-top:44px;\">\n          <h3 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Detalles Clave</h3>\n          <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n            <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Firma en tinta roja:</strong> la rúbrica de William Fisher Jr. está impresa en tinta roja &mdash;junto con el propio numeral de la denominación&mdash;, una medida adicional contra la falsificación poco común en el resto de la serie.</span>\n            </li>\n            <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Papel de seguridad:</strong> impreso sobre papel con motas de mica y fibras azules incrustadas, tecnología temprana contra la falsificación empleada por Hall and Sellers.</span>\n            </li>\n            <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Reverso:</strong> viñeta grabada de paisaje rural con orla decorativa y la advertencia &ldquo;TO COUNTERFEIT IS DEATH&rdquo;.</span>\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n        </section>\n\n      </section>\n\n      <div style=\"max-width:760px; margin:0 auto 64px; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.15);\"></div>\n\n      <!-- ===== CINCO CHELINES ===== -->\n      <section id=\"5-chelines\" style=\"max-width:760px; margin:0 auto;\">\n\n        <h2 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,30px); color:#1c1a15; text-align:center; margin:0 0 28px;\">Cinco Chelines (&ldquo;A Crown&rdquo;)</h2>\n\n        <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 0 40px;\">\n          <button\n            data-zoom-trigger=\"pa-5s\"\n            aria-label=\"Ampliar imagen del billete de cinco chelines\"\n            style=\"all:unset; display:block; width:100%; position:relative; cursor:zoom-in;\"\n          >\n            <picture>\n              <source srcset=\"uploads/pennsylvania-colonial-5-shillings-1773-640.webp 640w, uploads/pennsylvania-colonial-5-shillings-1773.webp 564w\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n              <img\n                src=\"uploads/pennsylvania-colonial-5-shillings-1773.jpg\"\n                alt=\"Billete colonial de cinco chelines de Pensilvania, 1773, anverso arriba y reverso abajo\"\n                width=\"564\"\n                height=\"873\"\n                loading=\"lazy\"\n                decoding=\"async\"\n                style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto;\"\n              />\n            </picture>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>\n              Ampliar\n            </span>\n          </button>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center; font-style:italic;\">Anverso (arriba) y reverso (abajo) — Colección de Notofilia.com</span>\n\n          \n            <div\n              role=\"dialog\"\n              aria-modal=\"true\"\n              aria-label=\"Billete de cinco chelines ampliado\"\n              data-zoom-dialog=\"pa-5s\" hidden style=\"display:none\"\n              style=\"position:fixed; inset:0; z-index:50; background:rgba(5,5,4,0.94); display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\"\n            >\n              <button\n                data-zoom-close\n                aria-label=\"Cerrar\"\n                style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; right:28px; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.4); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:22px; line-height:1; width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer;\"\n              >&times;</button>\n\n              <div style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; left:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.25); border-radius:999px; padding:6px;\">\n                <button disabled=\"\" aria-label=\"Alejar\" style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\">&minus;</button>\n                <span style=\"min-width:56px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; color:#e7ddc4; letter-spacing:0.05em;\"></span>\n                <button disabled=\"\" aria-label=\"Acercar\" style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\">&#43;</button>\n              </div>\n\n              <div\n                style=\"overflow:hidden; max-width:92vw; max-height:74vh; touch-action:none;\"\n              >\n                <picture>\n                  <source srcset=\"uploads/pennsylvania-colonial-5-shillings-1773.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n                  <img\n                    src=\"uploads/pennsylvania-colonial-5-shillings-1773.jpg\"\n                    alt=\"Billete colonial de cinco chelines de Pensilvania, vista ampliada\"\n                    draggable=\"false\"\n                    style=\"display:block; max-width:92vw; max-height:74vh; width:auto; height:auto; transform:; cursor:; user-select:none;\"\n                  />\n                </picture>\n              </div>\n\n              <span style=\"margin-top:18px; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#b7ab8a; font-style:italic;\">Arrastra para mover &middot; Rueda del ratón para ampliar</span>\n            </div>\n          \n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">País / Provincia</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">América Británica &mdash; Provincia de Pensilvania</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Entidad Emisora</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Asamblea General de Pensilvania, bajo el reinado de Jorge III</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Denominación</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Cinco Chelines (equivalente a &ldquo;A CROWN&rdquo;, una corona) &middot; No. 973</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Fecha de Emisión</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">1 de octubre de 1773 &mdash;apenas semanas antes del Motín del Té de Boston</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Impresor</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Hall and Sellers, Filadelfia (sucesores de la imprenta de Benjamin Franklin)</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Firmas</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Jas. Hartley, Alex. Todd y Jos. Mifflin, comisionados firmantes</span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Referencia de Catálogo</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Friedberg Fr. PA-166</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <section style=\"margin-top:44px;\">\n          <h3 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Detalles Clave</h3>\n          <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n            <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Sello grabado:</strong> pequeño escudo real coronado al centro, con la leyenda parcialmente visible &ldquo;...CROWN...JUSTI...&rdquo;, alusión a la autoridad real bajo la cual se emitía la moneda.</span>\n            </li>\n            <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Reverso:</strong> viñeta grabada de un paisaje con un gran rayo de sol naciente sobre una arboleda, enmarcada por una orla floral, y la advertencia &ldquo;TO COUNTERFEIT IS DEATH&rdquo;.</span>\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n        </section>\n\n      </section>\n\n      <blockquote style=\"max-width:760px; margin:56px auto 0; padding:28px 0 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.15);\">\n        <p style=\"font-size:20px; font-style:italic; line-height:1.7; color:#4a4331; margin:0 0 10px;\">Más de tres años antes de la Declaración de Independencia, las trece colonias británicas ya emitían su propio papel moneda &mdash;autorizado por sus asambleas legislativas, pero siempre bajo la autoridad nominal de la Corona&mdash; para paliar la crónica escasez de monedas de oro y plata acuñadas. La imprenta Hall and Sellers de Filadelfia, sucesora del taller de Benjamin Franklin, se convertiría con los años en uno de los impresores oficiales de la moneda continental durante la propia Guerra de Independencia.</p>\n        <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33;\">&mdash; Nota de contexto histórico</span>\n      </blockquote>\n\n      <section style=\"max-width:760px; margin:32px auto 0; padding-top:24px; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n        <h2 style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.18em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 12px; font-style:normal;\">Fuentes</h2>\n        <ul style=\"margin:0; padding:0 0 0 20px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.7; color:#5c4e33; font-style:italic;\">\n          <li>Newman, Eric P. <em>The Early Paper Money of America.</em></li>\n          <li>Heritage Auctions — <a href=\"https://www.ha.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#6b521f;\">ha.com</a></li>\n          <li>Numista — <a href=\"https://en.numista.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#6b521f;\">numista.com</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </section>\n\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  \n\n</div>",
